==Battleground==
*1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns.
*1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s (400%) spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Zigge]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*1 [[Zigge]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Squire Rel]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Zackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**3 [[Zang Roo]]s spawn, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
**3 [[Dagshund]]s spawn, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is very similar to an Empire Of Cats Chapter 3 zombie outbreak, as all the zombies are at 50% magnification. Bring Sifu Cat and a Z-Killer if one is worried.

